  "description": "Adds Shen and reworks official champions 002-007 as Lucian, Orianna, Briar, Sivir, Kled, and Xayah. Version 0.9.1 rebuilds Xayah at native final scale with stable movement, clear face and fully independent Q/E/R bodies and VFX; Q and R now leave bounded, damage-free endpoint Feather visuals, while a Mod API 0.8 native count mirror blocks built-in AI from spending E below two Feathers. Kled's compact HUD, Ban/Pick grid and encyclopedia surfaces use source-direct portraits for clearer facial detail. Xayah still uses auditable caster-side Feather counts because Mod API 0.8 cannot safely identify, remove and recall persistent per-feather map entities. Includes ImageGen actor, VFX, icons, Ban/Pick art, full-body encyclopedia art, Rift quality assets, deterministic elemental drakes and pinned official ability audio. Built for Teamfight Manager 2 v0.5.0 Mod API 0.8.",
